     1,
     "\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"FONT-SIZE:12pt;FONT-FAMILY:&#39;Calibri&#39;;COLOR:#000000\">\r\n<div>Well the hard part was understanding what the algorithm was actually \r\nexpecting because the terms used are a little different. I watched these three \r\nvideos:</div>\r\n<div><a title=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qt2ufTPCWwI\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qt2ufTPCWwI\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v%3Dqt2ufTPCWwI&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792478805322000&amp;usg=AOvVaw03Xq9Atf1kGvR0_ODQD3Gj\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qt2ufTPCWwI</a></div>\r\n<div><a title=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XFX6ukqHOWM\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XFX6ukqHOWM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v%3DXFX6ukqHOWM&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792478805322000&amp;usg=AOvVaw12ZCBXzELODPOH_CvYIzIU\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XFX6ukqHOWM</a></div>\r\n<div><a title=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fTX8GghbBPc\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fTX8GghbBPc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v%3DfTX8GghbBPc&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792478805322000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Syze-0qb78E2nqdo47Fow\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fTX8GghbBPc</a></div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div>I was trying to match the functions she was using with their GUI \r\nequivalent. From my sample data set I couldn’t quite figure out what as supposed \r\nto be time and status and if status was also the target variable. I think it \r\nwould help immensely if I could get definitions of time and status. </div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<div style=\"FONT-SIZE:12pt;FONT-FAMILY:&#39;Calibri&#39;;COLOR:#000000\">Adaryl \r\n&quot;Bob&quot; Wakefield, MBA<br>Data Geek \r\nExtraordinaire<br><a href=\"tel:(913)%20938-6685\" value=\"+19139386685\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">913.938.6685</a><br><a href=\"http://www.linkedin.com/in/bobwakefieldmba\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.linkedin.com/in/bobwakefieldmba&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792478805322000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2QMiRJ6LjCLbon_q2zNQAB\">www.linkedin.com/in/bobwakefieldmba</a></div></div></div></div>"
